### =====================================================================
### University.http - testo API-në me JWT (Pjesa 2)
### Kliko "Send request" mbi çdo kërkesë. Ekzekutoji me radhë!
### Porti duhet të përputhet me Properties/launchSettings.json (profili https).
### =====================================================================

@host = https://localhost:7232

### 1) Kurset - publike, pa token -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/courses

### 2) Studentët PA token -> 401 Unauthorized ("kush je?")
GET {{host}}/api/students

### 3) Hyrje si Admin -> marrim JWT
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@uni.test",
  "password": "Parola123!"
}

### Tokeni ruhet automatikisht nga përgjigja e mësipërme
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.$.token}}

### 4) Kush jam? -> email-i dhe rolet nga tokeni
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5) Studentët ME token -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6) Kurs i ri (vetëm Admin) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WEB202",
  "title": "Aplikacione Web të avancuara",
  "credits": 6,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "professorId": 1
}

### 7) Hyrje si studentja Ana (Id = 1)
# @name ana
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.gashi@student.test",
  "password": "Parola123!"
}

###
@anaToken = {{ana.response.body.$.token}}

### 8) Ana provon të krijojë kurs -> 403 Forbidden ("e di kush je, por s'ke leje")
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HACK1",
  "title": "Kurs i paautorizuar",
  "credits": 1,
  "departmentId": 1
}

### 9) Ana regjistron VETEN (studentId 1) në RK301 (courseId 3) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 3
}

### 10) Ana provon të regjistrojë DRENIN (studentId 2) -> 403 (mbrojtja IDOR)
POST {{host}}/api/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "courseId": 2
}

### 11) Ana provon të vendosë notë -> 403 (vetëm Admin/Professor)
PUT {{host}}/api/enrollments/4/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grade": 10
}

### 12) Admini vendos notën -> 204
PUT {{host}}/api/enrollments/4/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grade": 8
}
